      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"setback\" though. i didn't just miss a step, i failed at the most basic level. i've spent three years building a house on sand. everyone in my lab looks at me like i'm some kind of prodigy, and now i'm just a fraud. i look at them and i just feel sick. it feels like there's no way back from this. it feels like there's no point in even trying to \"fix\" it when the person who did the work is just... fundamentally broken.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
